# Large / generated sweep results — regenerated by the sweep, too big for GitHub (>100MB).
# The visualise pages handle the CSV being absent (they run the sweep to create it).
# Recursive so subfolders like AWS_Results/ are covered too.
data/experiment_results/*.csv
data/experiment_results/**/*.csv

